  "description": "New full straight graph y=x-3. Intercepts (0,-3),(3,0), with x visible to9 and y to6. Source308 asks inverse values and inequalities for the expression x-3. A new numeric frame and unlabelled graph, not the fig-77 line.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "New full straight graph y=x-3. Intercepts (0,-3),(3,0), with x visible to9 and y to6. Source308 asks inverse values and inequalities for the expression x-3. A new numeric frame and unlabelled graph, not the fig-77 line. This is newly authored mathematics, not a recovered original. Figure 77 was visually inspected only for general axes styling and is not provenance. Numeric scales, plotting windows and panel layout are deliberate authored additions. No formula is printed on the graph.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "exercise": "308",
        "text": "作式 $y=x-3$ 给出的函数的图象。利用图象求 $x$ 值的集合，已知式 $x-3$ 的值：\na) 等于 $4$；\nb) 等于 $-2$；\nc) 大于 $4$；\nd) 小于 $5$。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "一般地，式 $y=kx+l$ 给出的函数的图象是直线。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "我们知道，作一条直线只要确定直线上两个点的位置就行了。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c2-s4-n20",
        "text": "如果线性函数的定义域不包括所有的数，那么它的图象是直线上点的子集（例如，射线、线段、离散点的集合）。"
      }
    ],
